                "title": "Verve Knob with Disk Rose",
                "description": "The Verve Knob with Disk Rose is part of Emtek's Modern Designer Collection. It fits in well with the modern style of many homes. Its stylish design features a  modern profile with a machined inset. The Verve Knobset with Disk Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.  It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from a wide selection of contemporary finishes.",
